# Code style

Full prefs: `docs/code-style-preferences.md` (read before finishing UI/TS edits). Preferences, not build errors; prefer format-on-save.

Quick musts: tabs; JSX open/content/close on separate lines when multi-attr; static Tailwind tokens only; no raw `<svg>` in pages (icons under `apps/web/src/components/icons/`); catalog selected = `asgreen`, dark chrome = `sky` (not near-black); navigate chrome per docs (shafted arrows vs chevrons vs hover arrows).
